        "source_note": "Runs 3 and 4 establish a higher-pressure MgAl2O4 phase with CaTi2O4-type Cmcm structure. The authors construct its second-order Birch curve by fixing recovered V0, assuming K0'=4, and calculating K0 from the one usable compressed run-4 cell; run-2 CaTi2O4-type peaks were too weak and overlapped for a reliable cell volume.",
