      "record_kind": "published",
      "notes": "CaTi2O4-type product established by runs 3 and 4, distinct from the lower-pressure CaFe2O4-type run-2 phase. A one-point construction, not a multi-point fit: the only compressed volume is the in-situ run-4 observation after laser heating, and V0 was measured after recovery.",
      "fit_datasets": ["mgal2o4_cati2o4_funamori_1998_text_pv"],
